    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "When a critical equipment failure at Kepco SPC Power's Unit 2 triggered a power outage, it left more than 950 megawatts unavailable. Facing the heatwave impact of seasonal demand, the grid guardians responded by issuing an emergency response to stabilize the grid. This decisive action, a load shedding measure, was a courageous decision to prevent the complete collapse of the region's energy infrastructure.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Hero",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-2",
          "result-0"
        ],
        "center": "how-2",
        "center_kind": "how",
        "channel": "toned",
        "channel_role": "element_centered",
        "composition_mode": "ADR-0008",
        "salience_rank": 1
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "From the perspective of the authorities, the crisis began with a grid incident when Kepco's unit unexpectedly shutdown. They watched as a significant loss of generation capacity and a demand spike pushed the system to its limit. Their subsequent emergency measure, an operational procedure to avoid overload, was the necessary, drastic response to avert a larger catastrophe for the Philippines.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Hero",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2"
        ],
        "center": "who-2",
        "center_kind": "who",
        "channel": "focalized",
        "channel_role": "element_centered",
        "focal": "who-2",
        "composition_mode": "ADR-0008",
        "salience_rank": 2,
        "focal_role_id": "who-2"
      },
      "warnings": [
        "pseudo p2: focalized channel but center 'who-2' does not instantiate a card vantage seat"
      ],
      "fit": 0.78
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The system overseer, faced with compounding system vulnerabilities from other long-running plant outages, declared a high-level warning. This alert was a direct response to the equipment failure that first destabilized the energy deficit in the Visayas. Their intervention aimed to protect the region from the full impact of the supply shortfall.",
      "source": {
